Package: gplvm
Title: Bayesian Gaussian Process Latent Variable Model
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("First", "Last", email = "your@email.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements sparse Bayesian Gaussian Process Latent Variable Models
    (BGPLVM) for dimensionality reduction and latent structure learning in
    single-cell data. Uses variational inference with inducing points
    (Titsias 2009; Titsias & Lawrence 2010) for scalability to >5000 cells.
    Supports 2D/3D visualization embeddings, per-cell uncertainty quantification,
    and 1D pseudo-time inference with posterior credible intervals.
